<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #000000; padding: 20px;">
    <p>Dear {{name}},</p>

    <p>We are pleased to inform you that your spot for <b>EGM Split 2026</b> has been successfully assigned as <b>{{spotType}}</b>.</p>

    <div style="{{show_payment}}">
        <p>To complete your registration, a payment of <b>{{price}}</b>€ is required.</p>

        <p>Your personal reference number is <b>{{reference}}</b>, which can also be consulted it in the EGM App.</p>

        <p>Please ensure that the payment is completed by <b>{{deadline}}</b>. Below you will find the available payment methods and the necessary instructions.</p>

        <p><strong>1. Payment by card</strong></p>

        <div style="margin-left: 20px;">
            <p>To pay by card, please log in to the EGM App and select the 'Pay with Stripe' option on your user page. <strong>Please note that this payment method includes commission fees, in accordance with the platform’s policy.</strong></p>
            <p>When proceeding with the payment:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Please include {{name}} - {{reference}} to ensure correct identification of your payment</li>
                <li>If an invoice is required for an entity or section, please provide the relevant tax data by selecting the option “Buying as a company” at the bottom of the Stripe payment form.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <p><strong>2. Payment by bank transfer</strong></p>
        <div style="margin-left: 20px;">
            <p>If you prefer to pay by bank transfer, please use the following details:</p>
            <p>
              <b>Payment reference:</b><br>
              {{name}} - {{reference}} - EGM Split 2026
            </p>

            <p style="margin-left: 20px;">ESN Split bank details:</p>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Beneficiary:</strong> Erasmus studentska mreža Split</li>
              <li><strong>Beneficiary address:</strong> Ruđera Boškovića 31, 21000 Split, Croatia</li>
              <li><strong>Bank name:</strong> OTP banka</li>
              <li><strong>Bank address:</strong> Domovinskog rata 61, 21000 Split, Croatia</li>
              <li><strong>IBAN:</strong> HR4524070001100427189</li>
              <li><strong>SWIFT CODE:</strong> OTPVHR2X</li>
            </ul>

            <p>
              If you are making a single transfer for multiple participants, please send an email to <a href="mailto:egm-oc@esn.org">egm-oc@esn.org </a>with:
              <ul>
                <li>The proof of payment, and</li>
                <li>The <b>name, surname</b>and <b>reference number</b> of each participant included in the transfer.</li>
              </ul>
            </p>

            <p>
              <b>Proof of Payment</b><br>
              After completing the payment (by card or bank transfer), please upload your proof of payment using the dedicated button on your user page in the EGM App. The document must clearly display the payer’s name, surname, and reference number to allow verification.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <p>If you have any questions regarding the registration or payment process please write to <a href="mailto:egm-oc@esn.org">egm-oc@esn.org</a>.</p>
    <p>Kind regards,</p>
</body>
</html>